  <Title type="string">Towards negative space and its landlord</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Chiamaka Kowalczyk talks about eleven shades of white and one impostor. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
